Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `items` cannot be moved while `got` is still looking into it
  --> Tests/UI/trait_dispatch_loan_keeps_its_owner.jet:28:19
    |
 28 |     print(consume(items))
    |                   ^^^^^
 Why: `got` is a live read view into `items[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `got` before changing `items`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
